.TH MSEPARATE 1 "November 2026" "mseparate" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mseparate \- analyze audio and execute multi-model source-separation plans
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mseparate
.RI [ input ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mseparate
analyzes audio, builds a plan from the enabled model registry and can execute compatible source-separation tasks when
.B --execute
is explicitly requested. The current registry includes HT-Demucs six-stem ONNX separation and MelBand RoFormer vocals separation. The input file is not modified.
.PP
The existing
.B melband-roformer
and
.B separate
workflows are unchanged.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --analysis-only
Analyze the input without displaying an execution plan.
.TP
.B --plan-only
Analyze the input and display the currently available execution plan without inference.
.TP
.B --output-dir DIR
Directory used for separated stems and a requested report file.
.TP
.B --report [PATH]
Write a JSON report. If PATH is omitted, use mseparate-report.json in the output directory.
.TP
.B --models-dir DIR
Override the local model storage directory.
.TP
.B --device auto|cuda|cpu
Select the inference device. The explicit cuda mode requires CUDAExecutionProvider and does not permit CPU fallback. The auto mode may fall back to CPU.
.TP
.B --execute
Explicitly execute the planned separation tasks. This can download model assets and use the selected compute device.
.TP
.B --prepare-models
Download and prewarm eligible model assets. For the ONNX model, this uses the Hugging Face Hub cache.
.TP
.B --no-download
Never access the network. Execution requires all model assets to be available locally.
.TP
.B --download-timeout SECONDS
Per-request network timeout for SHA-pinned assets (default 30 seconds).
.TP
.B --download-retries N
Maximum attempts per SHA-pinned asset (default 3).
.TP
.B --inference-timeout SECONDS
Per-task inference timeout; zero disables the timeout.
.TP
.B --max-depth N
Set the maximum refinement depth for the execution plan.
.TP
.B --list-models
List registry models and their eligibility.
.TP
.B --verbose
Print additional diagnostics.
.TP
.B --version
Print the mseparate version.
.SH DATA
By default, persistent data is stored under
.I ~/.local/share/mseparate/
with separate models, registry, cache and jobs directories. The
.B MSEPARATE_HOME
environment variable overrides the root directory.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Analysis or requested execution completed successfully.
.TP
.B 1
Model preparation or inference failed, or a report could not be written.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid arguments or input/registry error.
.SH NOTES
The HT-Demucs ONNX backend downloads its model through Hugging Face Hub. The upstream package manages this cache independently of mseparate's SHA-pinned asset manager. The six output stems are drums, bass, other, vocals, guitar and piano; guitar and piano are estimates and may contain bleed or artifacts. The fp16weights option reduces download and storage size, not inference memory use.
.PP
Passing
.B --device cuda
requires a working CUDA Execution Provider. No actual GPU inference or quality result is implied by CPU-only tests.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR melband-roformer (1)
